the runner's own log lines, verbatim:
  8698:2026-10-13T23:53:59Z STOP-FILE C:\Users\Opal Bloomberg\Desktop\wk-harvest-runner-pin-995adcaeaa\.runtime\harvest-cycle\STOP present: ending after the current job (108 pairs done)
  8811:2026-10-13T23:53:59Z CYCLE bbg 20261013T185816Z floor 2026-10-12 asked 242 new 0 held 2 failed 0 stopped stopped_by_operator completed false
