  108 pairs were done when the stop was seen, and the job in flight was allowed to finish:
  ZERO PAIRS LOST, which is the whole reason the stop is a file and not a kill.
  NOTE on the instrument: the first attempt at the field read above passed an MSYS /c/... path to native
  Python, which cannot resolve it (FileNotFoundError on a file that demonstrably exists). Re-run with the
  Windows path. A reader who saw only that traceback would have concluded the record was absent.

